deepNest_app_main_detail --> deepNest_app_main_home : <span class='xsm-pill'><span class='xsm-ev'>BACK</span></span>
deepNest_error --> deepNest_app : <span class='xsm-pill'><span class='xsm-ev'>RESTART</span></span>

